  <p class="tagline">What I'm focused on right now. Inspired by <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">nownownow.com</a>.</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Building</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>WhatCanHelp</strong> — a free assistive technology discovery tool. 5,000+
      products from 23 vendors, freeform AI intake, plain-language guidance, and exportable
      PDF reports for funding meetings and IEP appendices. It's the main thing I'm building
      right now.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>marsh.city</strong> — this site, still growing into a living portfolio.
      Astro, GitHub Pages, content as conversation.
    </p>

    <h2>Working</h2>
    <p>
      Director of Technology at an assistive technology & older adult services nonprofit in Duluth, MN.
      Assistive technology evaluation, infrastructure, and keeping everything running.
    </p>

    <h2>Exploring</h2>
    <p>
      AI engineering roles. Looking for teams building real products with LLMs.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p style="color: var(--fg-soft); font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 3rem;">
    Updated June 2026
